* LT6106 High-Side Current Sense Amplifier
.lib LTC7.lib

* 12V Power Supply (Primary Input)
V1 IN 0 12

* Load Current (100 mA)
I1 LOAD 0 100m

* Shunt Resistor (0.1 ohm)
* Vsense = 100 mA * 0.1 ohm = 10 mV
Rsense IN LOAD 0.1

* Gain Setting Resistors
* Gain = Rout / Rin = 10k / 100 = 100
* Target Vout = Vsense * Gain = 10 mV * 100 = 1.0 V
Rin IN IN_PLUS 100
Rout OUT 0 10k

* LT6106 Instance
* Standard LTspice subcircuit pinout: IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT
X1 IN_PLUS LOAD IN 0 OUT LT6106

* Analysis Directive
.tran 2m

.end
